<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">VAEFWESO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluva ya Mutumi Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vaefweso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efw</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluva ya mutumi Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">VAEFWESO</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluva yino ya Pawulo kwa Vaefweso yandikwe luvala lumwe na baluva yila ya Vakolosayi mu mwaka gwa sitini luhuma kuleleka kwa Chilisito. Mu sula ya 1:1. Tungumuwona Pawulo angitambutsa kuta mwene yo andiche baluva yino. Vasomi wolofu vangidichila kuta Pawulo yo andiche chitabu chino cha Vaefweso. Nayivaje baluva yino yilihela samuso tsa mwene Pawulo kota fyoyili mu baluva yila yo avandichilye Vakolosayi. Kwasawuli iyo, yifuluche kuta aganaga baluva iyo yipilime mu fikundi vitunga fya vanya litumbilo va mukova ugo luvala lo andikaga baluva iyo. Kaha mu sula ya 3:1 na 4:1 na 6:20, Pawulo anlonga kuta avaga mu nyumba ya vawopwa iho ho andikaga baluva yino. Mu sula ya 6:21,22, tun'wona kuta Pawulo ayitumile baluva yino kukolela kwa Tikiko yo avaga mu lujendo lwa kuchijendela chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito cha ku Efweso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muji gwa Efweso gwavaga mukomi na gwavaga muji gwa wutavala wa Valumi mu mukova gwa Asiya ndodo. Mu chitabu cha Ng'olwa 19:23-31 Tunsoma kuta muji gwa Efweso gwavaga mutambulwa. Kwasawuli ya nyumba ya lilungu lyo lyavaga litsentsilwe chang'ani kwa kulifugamila lilungu lidala va Chijilichi lyo lyachemwaga Alitemi. Mu sula 2:1-7, yin'woneka kuta, chikundi cha vanya litumbilo cha ku Efweso chavaga chantsitse kwa wuvetso wukomi, lechelelo hambele chikisemwaje.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawulo anlonga mu hono halongola na hono ha kavili ha baluva yino hila Mulungu fyo avahagwe vanu na kuvakulusa mu ndongwa ntsibi kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito. Pawulo anguchihwanitsa chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito na muvili, kaha antambula kuta Chilisito yo mutwi gwake. Kaha anguchihwanitsa na nyumba, na anlonga kuta Chilisito yo liganga lya musinji awu liganga lyo linyamana lya kutsenjela lya nyumba iyo. Mu hono ha kavili ya baluva iyi, Pawulo anguvalajitsa na kuvalajila hila munu yo amutumbye Chilisito fyo an'ganika kikala.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fyofili mu baluva yino</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo angitambutsa na kuvasamusa vanu va ku Efweso mu sula ya 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Kahi anlonga hila vanu va chikundi cha vanya litumbilo fyo vihantsitse na Chilisito mu sula ya 1:3-3:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ankwandika na kulajila hila vanu yo amutumbye Chilisito fyo an'ganika kikala mu sula ya 4:1-6:20.</para>
  <para style="io">Hawudugo tungumuwona Pawulo asindilitsa baluva yake mu sula ya 6:21-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Heni Pawulo mutumi va Chilisito Yesu kota fyo angavye Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Heni mutumi Pawulo yo ntsandiche baluva yino henye vanu wo muveye vahagulwa kwa kumutumbila Chilisito Yesu wo mungikala ku Efweso.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Wuwuya na wusichimafu wo wunhuma kwa Mulungu Dada vetu na kwa Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito wuve hamwe na henye.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu atuhagwe kukolela kwa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Atsumitswaje Mulungu na Dada va Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito! Kwakuva kwa kihantsa na Chilisito atupelaga hetwe wuwuya kwa kutugavila fifunje fya Muhe va Mulungu kuhuma kilanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Inyi hoyavaga ying'acha kuwumbwa Mulungu atuhagwe kwa kugana mwene tuve vahagulwa kukolela kwa Chilisito na wo tulihela ndongwa tsibi halutalo hake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Kwa wugano wake, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />luhuma hamutalo inyi ho yavaga ing'acha kuwumbwa Mulungu avaga aganile mwene kutuleta kwa mwene kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Duve, tumutsumitsaje Mulungu kwasawuli ya wuwuya wake wukomi wo atuditye hetwe bule kukolela kwa Mwanage yo amuganite. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Hetwe tun'gombolwa kwa chifo cha Chilisito, wo wuhulumilo wa ndongwa tsetu ntsibi. Kota hila lusungu lwake lukomi fyoluli, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />na hila Mulungu fyo atugavye nenye nenye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Kwa wudaho na ntselo, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Mulungu adisile kota hila fyo aganaga mwene, na kwasawuli iyo atulaje mupanjo gwake gwa wufiho go avaga apantsile kugukwitsa kukolela kwa Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Holwavaga kufika luvala lwake akakwitsaje chila cho chaganikaga, kwa kufivika ho hamwe mu wutavala wa Chilisito fila fyeka fyo fiwumbitwe Kilanga na muinyi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Kwa kula kihantsa na Chilisito, hetwe tuhagulwe tuve vanu vake luhuma inyi ying'acha kuwumbwa, na kota hila fyo aganaga Mulungu yo aditaga chila chinu kota hila fyo anlamula mwene. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Mulungu adisile ihyo ili hetwe Vayawudi wo twalongwe kumuhuvila Chilisito tumutsumilaje Mulungu kwa wuvina wake!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Hihilaga na henye vanu wosi Vayawudi mwahuliche ndongwa tsa wukweli, yo Ndongwa Nofu ya Chilisito yo yavaletye wukuluso. Mulungu ili kulajila kuta henye muli vanu vake, akavavichilaje chitango kwa kuvapela Muhe vake yo avaga alontsile kuta akuvapela. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Uyo Muhe va Mulungu yo atuditaga twanuchile fila Mulungu fyo alontsile kuta akuvapela vanu vake, na lulongwa ulo lunlajila kuta Mulungu akuvagombola nachene vanu vake, na hetwe tumupelaje Mulungu wuvina.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo angumusuka Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Luhuma hala ho ntsahuliche fyo mumutumbye Mutwa Yesu na fyo munguvagana vahagulwa va Mulungu, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />sintsahogwe kuleka kumulumba Mulungu kwasawuli yenyu. Ntsinguvihuka hala ho ntsingumusuka Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ntsinkwendelela kumusuka Mulungu va Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito, yo Dada munya wuvina avapele henye Muhe vake yo akuvadita muve vahagulwa na kuvagubulila ili mumutsele mwene hilo. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Kaha ntsingumusuka Mulungu ili mupelwe mwangatsa gwa kulitsela lihuvilo lila lyo avachemye, na kuwutsela wufuchifu na wuvina wo avalonje vanu vake vahagulwa kuta akuvapela. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Ntsingumusuka Mulungu ili muwutsele wuvetso wake wukomi wo siwiganitswaga wo atuvichye hetwe wo tumutumbye. Uwo wuvetso wo wunkola katsi kwa hetwe wihwana na wula wuvetso wake wukomi, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />wo amutsilipulye Chilisito na kumuvika ku lubali lwake lulilo lwa kuhesimilwa uko Kilanga. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Uko Kilanga Chilisito antavala, kuchanya ndalahela kulutila chila wuntsajila na mamulaka, na wuvetso, na wuvina, na chila litawa litambulwa live muinyi yino na inyi yila yo yinkutsa. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nayo Mulungu avisile finu fyeka five ha wutavala wa Chilisito, kaha amudisile ave muvina va chila chinu kwasawuli ya chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito go muvili gwake Chilisito, nacho chinkwila kukolela kwa mwene yo fyeka mugati mwa fyeka!<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuhuma mu chifo kwinjila mu wumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Iho hamutalo henye mwavaga kota mufweye kwasawuli simwamuhulikitsaga Mulungu na mwaditaga ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi halutalo hake. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Luvala lula mwikalaga na mwatsifwatitsaga ndongwa tsa ntsovelo tsa muinyi yino, na tsa yula yo muvina wa wuvetso wa hilanga, muhe yula yo anguvatavala vanu vala wo sinambevamuhulikitse Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Nambe na hetwe tweka iho hamutalo twavaga kota vawo, na twikalaga kwa kutsifwatitsa ndongwa tsa muinyi na kudita hila fyo jin'gana mivili jetu. Hetwe natwe Mulungu aganikaga atutove kota munu yoyuve hela.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Lechelelo Mulungu kwa wugano wake wukomi wo siwupimikaga, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />nambe hala ho twavaga vanu wo tufweye kwasawuli ya kuleka kumuhulikitsa Mulungu, mwene atudisile tuve wumi hamwe na Chilisito. Ino lelo mukuluswe kwa wuwuya wa Mulungu hela. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kwa kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu, Mulungu atutsilipwe hamwe nayo, ili tukikale hamwe nayo uko Kilanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Mulungu aludisile lulongwa ulo ili kuvalajila vanu va siku tsino tsa wudugo wuwuya wake wukomi lo atuditye hetwe kwa kumutumbila Chilisito Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Kwakuva mukuluswe kwa wuwuya wa Mulungu hela kwa kumutumbila Chilisito, siyo kwa kikangatsa henye kwasawuli icho cho chifunje luhuma kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Munu alekaje kidutsa kuta aveye ihyo kwa kikangatsa mwene hela. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Hetwe twawumbitwe na Mulungu, na atudisile tumutumbe mugati mwa Chilisito Yesu, ili tudite ndongwa tsa wuwuya tso alongwe kutuvichila chang'ani luhuma hamutalo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wumwe kwa kihatsa na Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Mwiwukaje kuta henye iho hamutalo henye vanu wosi Vayawudi, iwo Vayawudi vavachemaga henye, “Vanu wo sivinje likumbi,” kuno vene vichemaga kuta, “Vanu wo vinje likumbi!” Vichemaga ihyo kwasawuli ya hila fyo viditye mu mivili jawo. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Luvala lula mwavaga kutali na Chilisito, kaha mwavaga kutali na vana va Isilaheli. Kwa wujentsi uwo wo mwavaga nawo wavadisile muve kutali na lilagano lya Mulungu, na ihyo mwavaga mulihela lihuvilo na mwavaga mulihela Mulungu umu muinyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Lechelelo henye wo mwavaga kutali na Mulungu, kwa kihantsa na Chilisito Yesu, sambi munkuva mulibulitswe kwa chifo chake. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Mwene Chilisito yo atuletye wusichimafu kwa kuvadita Vayawudi na vanu wosi Vayawudi tuve wovamwe. Kwa hila fyo agutawe muvili gwake, ahetsitse wutelani wo watulekanitsaga kota lukantsi. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Chilisito yo agavisile kulubali Malajitso geka ga Vayawudi na amuli tseka, ili kwa fikundi ifyo fivili ipatile likundi lipya lyo liwunganise na mwene, na kwa kudita ihyo awulete wusichimafu. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kukolela kwa chifo chake hala ha musalaba, Chilisito ahetsitse wula wutelani wa fikundi ifyo fivili, na kwa musalaba gwake akafihantsaje five chinu chimwe na kuchipatanisa na Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Ino lelo Chilisito atsitse kuvikula wusichimafu wo Ndongwa Nofu kwa vanu veka, kwa vala wosi Vayawudi wo vavaga kutali na Mulungu na kwa Vayawudi wo vavaga habehi na Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ihyo kukolela kwa Chilisito, Vayawudi na vala wosi Vayawudi tufuluche tumuhejelele Dada kwa Muhe va Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Duve ihyo henye wosi Vayawudi, siyo vajentsi na simuli kutali kaha. Henye sambi muveye vanyakaye na kaha muveye vayawo na vanu vahagulwa va Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Henye munakota nyumba ya Mulungu yo yitsentsilwe mwilanga mwa musinji gwa vatumi na valoli va Mulungu, na mwene Yesu Chilisito anakota liganga likomi lyo linyamana lya kutsenjela lya kulubali. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Mwene Chilisito yo munya kuyiwunganisa ili yive ngomi na kuva kota Nyumba nyagulwa ya Mutwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kwa kula kihantsa na Chilisito vanu wosi Vayawudi munkuva mutsentsilwe hohamwe mu nyumba iyo, ili muve hono ha kikala Mulungu kwa kukolela kwa Muhe vake.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Wutantsi wa Pawulo kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Ihyo heni Pawulo yo mbopitwe kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsa Chilisito Yesu, na yo ntsili jumbe venyu henye vanu wosi Vayawudi, ntsinguvasuchila Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Henye mwanga mwahuliche kuta Mulungu kwa wuwuya wake amelye heni wutantsi wuno wa kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu ili ntsivaditile henye. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Mulungu angubulye heni kwa nduntsuchilo lulongwa lwake ulo lwa lufiho. Kota hila fyo ntsivandichilye chidogo hela ndongwa itsi, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />na henye manyi musome ndongwa itsi tso ntsandiche, mukutsela fyo ntsinguyitsela yila fiho ya Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Iho hamutalo Mulungu sivavaga avagubulye vanu fiho iyo, ino lelo sambi Mulungu avagubulye vatumi na valoli vake vahagulwa kukolela kwa Muhe vake. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Fiho iyo yo iyi, kwa kuyidichila Ndongwa Nofu vanu wosi Vayawudi vawupate wuwuya. Vene wo filungo fya muvili gumwe na vali muwuhantso wa chila cho avaga alontsile Mulungu kuta akuvapela vanu kukolela kwa Chilisito Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Heni tsadisilwe mutantsi Ndongwa Nofu kwa wuwuya wa wiyeka na kwa wuvetso wa Mulungu na wuwuya wake wukomi. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nayivaje heni yontsili mudodo kulutila vanu veka vahagulwa va Mulungu, lechelelo amelye wuvetso ili ntsivavikulile vanu wosi Vayawudi Ndongwa Nofu na wula wufuchifu wa Chilisito wo sinambewulonjeche, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />kaha Mulungu amelye katsi ya kuvalonjela vanu veka hila mupanjo gwake gwa wufiho fyoguli. Mulungu yo awumbite finu fyeka avaga afihile fiho iyo luhuma katali, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />ili sambi kwa kukolela kwa chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito, avagubulile vatavala na vanya wuvetso mu inyi yo sinambeyitselaniche. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Mulungu aludisile lulongwa ulo luhuma baho hamutalo kota fyo aganaga mwene, nayo akaluditaje kukolela kwa Chilisito Yesu Mutwa vetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Duve kwa litumbilo lila lyo twapasile kwa kihantsa na Chilisito, sambi hetwe tufuluche tumuhejelele Mulungu kwa wukangatso kukolela litumbilo hela. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Ihyo ntsinguvagongola muleche kugotsola kwasawuli ya ng'odeko tsangu, ino mutselaje kuta ntsinkodeka ili henye mupate fwayida.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anguvasuchila Vaefweso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Ihyo kwa lulongwa ulo ntsin'fugama halutalo ha Mulungu Dada kumusuka, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />mwene yo mwantso gwa viwumbe vyeka fya muinyi na Kilanga. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ino heni ntsingumusuka Mulungu kota hila wufuchifu na wuvina wake fyowuli, avakangatse na kuvapela wuvetso mu numbula tsenyu kukolela kwa Muhe vake, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />na ntsingumusuka Chilisito ili ikale mu numbula tsenyu kwa hila fyo mungumutumbila. Ino kaha ntsingumusuka chila chinu cho munguchidita henye muchiditaje kwa wugano wa wukweli, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />ili henye hamwe na vanu veka vahagulwa va Mulungu mutsele hila Chilisito fyo angutugana ndalahela kwa wugano wo sinambewulonjeche. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Mutsele nachene wula wugano wa Chilisito wo wunlutila ntselo tseka, na kaha mupelwe chila chinu na muve kota fyo an'gana mwene Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Duve atsumitswaje Mulungu yo aditaga ndongwa tseka tsa mitinuso kulutila hila fyo tusukaga uwu kuhotsa, kota hila wuvetso wake fyo wuditaga katsi mugati mwetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Wukweli nachene yin'ganika chikundi cha Chilisito chimpele ntsumitso Mulungu siku tseka kukolela kwa Chilisito Yesu kwa filelo fyeka, Tavile!<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Wumwe mu muvili gwa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Duve lelo heni yontsili muwopwa kwasawuli ya wutantsi kwa Mutwa, ntsinguvagongola kuta mwikalaje kota hila fyo mwachemilwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Mun'ganika muvaje vanu va kwika, na vadeche, na vanya kikangatsa, nanye mwifumililaje na kilechela henye kwa henye kwa wugano. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mwikangatsaje kuva na wumwe mu Muhe va Mulungu kuno munguwunanahila wusichimafu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kuna muvili gumwe na Muhe va Mulungu yumwe hela, kota hila fyo mwachemilwe mu lihuvilo limwe hela. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Kuna Mutwa yumwe hela na litumbilo limwe na wubatitso wumwe, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />kuna Mulungu yumwe nayo yo Dada va hetwe tweka, nayo yo antavala finu fyeka, mugati mwa fyeka.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Chila munu apelitwe chifunje cha wiyeka kota hila fyo amugavye Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ihyo Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Fyo avaga kubita kuchanya ndalahela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">atweye chikundi cha vanu vawopwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">na akavatawulaje vave fifunje.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Ino lulongwa ulo lwa kulonga kuta, “Fyo avaga kubita kuchanya ndalahela kwa Mulungu,” luna mana yachi? Mana yake siyo kulonga kuta, iho hamutalo Chilisito isile mbaka hasi ndalahela ha inyi? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ihyo lelo yula yo isile siyo yo yuyulaga nda yo ahele kuchanya ko kulutye kuchanya kweka ili ave chila hono? <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Uyo yo agavise fifunje kwa vanu, na vanu vamwe avagavye wutumi, vamwe vave valoli, na vanji vave vavikutsi va Ndongwa Nofu, na vamwe vave vadimi na vamwe vadahitsi va ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Adisile ihyo ili avaviche chang'ani vahagulwa va Mulungu ili vatsidite katsi tso van'ganika kutsidita ili vave na wukangatso kota fyo guli muvili gwa Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Ihyo kwa kuludita lulongwa ulo, hetwe tweka tuwufichile wumwe wa litumbilo lya kumutsela Mwana va Mulungu, ili tuve vanu wo tukanje na kuva kota hila mwene Chilisito fyoali. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Kaha tuleche kuva kota fyali, fyo tunkunugitswa na mavimbi ga lulenga na kuno na kutegulwa na madahitso ga vanu vasugu na kutsifwata ndongwa tsawo tsa wudesi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Lechelelo tuve vanu wo tungilonjela wukweli kwa numbula tsinya wugano, na ihyo tukukalagala kwa chila lulongwa nambe kumufichila Chilisito yo mutavala vetu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Kwa kulongotswa na Chilisito, filungo fyeka fya muvili fivaga fyofimwe kwa midana, na muvili gweka guvaga hamwe kwa kutangwa na filungo fyake. Duve hala filungo fyo fikudita katsi yake finofu kota fyo yin'ganika, nago muvili gweka gunkalagala na kuva finofu kwa wugano.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wumi wupya na wumi wa katali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Ino lelo ntsinguvafundani kwa wuvetso wo amelye Mutwa, mulekaje kikala kota vanu vala wo sinambevamutsele Chilisito na kuhotsa ndongwa ntsibi ng'ani, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />nyala tsawo vanu kota iwo tsigubichwe na jitsa. Nawo vali kutali na wumi wa Mulungu kwasawuli ya wupufi na wudadambafu wowuli mu numbula tsawo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Vanu iwo vagaluche na valihela nyoni, nawo vitotsitse mu ndongwa tsa kuhonga nyoni na vangutsidomboya chila ndongwa ntsibi.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Lechelelo henye simwidahitse ndongwa tsinya ihyo kwa Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Kota hila fyo mwadahitswe ndongwa tsa Chilisito na kuva vafwasi vake, na mukadahitswaje wukweli kukolela mwene. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Mwadahitswe kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi tso mwatsiditaga iho hamutalo kota hila munu fyo awopolaga mwenda, ndongwa tsila tso mwaditaga hamutalo kwa kufwata mbafya tsa wudesi, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />na ihyo mun'ganika mugaluche wupya mu numbula tsenyu na mu mahotso genyu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Henye mun'ganika muve na wunu wupya wo wuwumbitwe kwa muhwano gwa Mulungu, vanu wo munlajila kuta mungikala hila fyo yin'ganika na kudita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Lelo muleche kuva vadesi! Chila munu an'ganika kumulonjela muyage ndongwa tsa wukweli, kwasawuli hetwe tuli chilungo chimwe mu muvili gwa Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Manyi muvipe, mulekaje kuyileka mbipo iyo yivambutse kudita ndongwa ntsibi, kahi mulekaje kikala na mbipo iyo munyi gweka. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Mwalahogola kulipela nyafwasi Lihoka livasume chinya ihyo. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Munu yo avaga muhitsi alahogola kuwupiluchila wuhitsi, ila an'ganika kukola katsi tso tsingidichilwa. Ili ave na finu fya kitanga mwene na fya kuvagavila vagayu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Kaha mulekaje kulonga lulongwa loluve lo luli fibi, chila luvala mulongaje ndongwa nofu ntsa wuwuya tso tsikuvatanga vanu vanji wo vanguvahulikitsa. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Mulekaje kumudita Muhe va Mulungu asusutale, kwasawuli uyo yo chitango cha Mulungu kwenyu ya kuta henye muchemilwe na Mulungu, na yo alajila kuta kuna siku Mulungu akutsa kuvagombola nachene. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Nachene mulekaje kuvipa, na kuva na ng'alatsi mu numbula tsenyu. Kaha mulekaje kiliga na kihuta matsi ho munlonga, na kiditila wubi wowuve. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Mun'ganika muve na numbula nofu na kaha mwiwonelaje lusungu, na chila munu amuhulumilaje muyage kota hila Mulungu fyo avahulumye henye kukolela kwa Chilisito.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kikala kota fyo an'gana Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Henye muveye vana va Mulungu yo anguvagana ndalahela, ihyo mun'ganika muvaje kota mwene Mulungu fyoali. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Nanye hila fyo mungikala mun'ganika muvaje na wugano kota hila Chilisito fyo atuganite nambe akitawulaje kwasawuli ya hetwe, ili ave nambiko yinya wununyililo na sadaka yo ayiganile Mulungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Lechelelo henye sambi muveye vahagulwa va Mulungu, ndongwa tsa kuvasa na valume na vadala vanji, na ndongwa tsa kuhanga nyoni, na kiwiniwa fyalahogola kuwoneka hagati henyu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kaha mulekaje kuva na ndongwa tsa chipufi na tsa nyoni, awu tsa wubisi, awu tsa wudasi. Henye mun'ganika muvaje vanu va kumulumba Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mun'ganika kutsela kuta munu yoyuve yo anvasa na valume na vadala vanji, awu yo an'dita ndongwa tsa kuhonga nyoni, na munya kiwiniwa awu munu yoyuve yo an'dita ndongwa kota itso, siakuhogola kupata chinu chochive mu Wuntsajila wa Chilisito na wa Mulungu. Kwasawuli munu munya kiwiniwa ihwanaga na munu yo angujifugamila milungu jinji.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mwalahogola kidichila kudeteletswa na munu kwa ndongwa tsake tsa chipufi hela, kwasawuli Mulungu siavaganaga vanu vala wo sinambevamuhulikitse. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ino sambi henye mwalahogola kihantsa nawo vanu kota iwo, <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />kwasawuli hala ha hamutalo henye mwavaga simumutsele Mulungu kota mwavaga mu jitsa, lechelelo sambi henye mumutsele Mulungu munakota muli mu mwangatsa kwa hila fyo mwihantsitse na Mutwa. Ino duve mun'ganika mwikalaje hila kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />kwasawuli manyi muve mungikala mu mwangatsa mukuva na wuwuya nachene, na mukidichilwa na Mulungu na kaha mukuva na wukweli. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Mun'ganika mujelaje kudita kota hila fyo an'gana Mutwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ino mwalahogola kihantsa mu ndongwa ntsibi, ila mun'ganika mumung'anulile chila munu yo an'gana kudita ndongwa kota itso. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Kwakuva ndongwa tso vangutsidita mu wufiho vanu wo sinambevamuhulikitse Mulungu, tsivaga tsa kuhonga nyoni, natso sitsifuluche tsilonjeche halutalo ha vanu. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Lechelelo chila chinu cho chigubulwaga mu mwangatsa, icho chiwonekaga. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Kwakuva chila chinu cho chigubulwaga chivaga mwangatsa. Kota hila fyo valongaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Ulamuche heve yo uvasise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">na utsilipuche heve yo ufweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">nayo Chilisito akukwangatsila.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ino lelo mwikalaje kwa kiyangalila. Munganika mwikalaje kota vanu vanya ntselo, na siyo kota vanu vapufi. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Luvala lo munalo muwutumilaje kwa kudita ndongwa nofu, kwasawuli siku tsino tsimemile wubi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ihyo mulekaje kuva kota vanu vapufi, ila mun'ganika kutsela chila Mutwa cho anguchigana muchidite.<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mulekaje kugala wujimbi, kwasawuli uwo wukwananga wumi wenyu, ila mulongotswaje na Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Nanye mwimbaje tsabuli na ntsimbo tsa kumutsumila Mulungu na ntsimbo tsinji tsa kulongontswa na Muhe va Mulungu. Mwimbaje na kumutsumila Mutwa mu numbula tsenyu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Siku tseka mumulumbaje Dada Mulungu kukolela kwa Mutwa Yesu Chilisito kwasawuli ya ndongwa tseka.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hila fyo vaganika kikala munu na vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Chila munu an'ganika amuhesimilaje muyage, kwasawuli ya hesima yila wo vanayo kwa Chilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Henye vadala muvahulikitsaje valume venyu kota hila fyo mungumuhulikitsa Mutwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Mulume amulongotsaje mudala vake, kota hila Chilisito fyo anguchilongotsa chikundi cha vanu wo vangumutumba mwene. Nayo Chilisito yo mukulusi va chikundi chake, nacho cho muvili gwake. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Kota hila chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito fyo chimuhulikitsaga Chilisito, ho hihyo vadala nawo van'ganika vavahulikitse valume vawo kwa chila chinu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Henye nanye valume muvaganaje vadala venyu kota hila Chilisito fyo achiganile chikundi chake, na akitawulaje mwene kwasawuli ya icho. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Chilisito adisile ihyo kukolela kwa Ndongwa tsake na ili chive chihagulwa na kuchidita chidichilwe na Mulungu kwa kuchihofuga kwa malenga. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Ihyo Chilisito afweye ili achipate chikundi chake chihagulwa cho chilihela nongwa yoyive awu chinu chochive cho chinhwana na ndongwa itso. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Hohihyo valume nawo van'ganika kuvagana vadala vawo kota hila fyo vangujigana mivili jawo, kwasawuli mulume yo angumugana mudala vake ankuva angigana mwene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kwakuva kuduhuli munu yoyuve yo aguvipilaga muvili gwake, ila agulisaga na kugufwika myenda. Hihyo nayo Chilisito fyo achituntsaga chikundi chake. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Hetwe tweka tuli filungo fya muvili gwake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Mandiko ganlonga, “Kwasawuli iyo mulume akumuleka dade na yuve, nayo akihantsa na mudala vake, nawo iwo vavili vakuva muvili gumwe.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Kuna wukweli wo wifihite mu ndongwa tsino, lechelelo heni ntsinlonga ndongwa tsa Chilisito na chikundi chake hela. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Nambe ihyo, chila mulume an'ganika amugane mudala vake kota fyo angigana mwene. Nayo mudala an'ganika amuhesimilaje mulume vake.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Madahitso kwa Vana na valeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Henye vana kwakuva mwihantsitse na Mutwa muvahesimilaje valeli venyu, kwasawuli ihyo fyo yin'ganika mudite. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Nambe amuli tsa Mulungu tsityaga, “Uvahesimilaje dado na yuwo, iyo yo amuli ndongola yo yongelitswe chila cho avaga alontsile Mulungu kuta akutupela, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />ili Mulungu akuditile wuwuyana na kikala luvala lutali muinyi.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Henye nanye va dada mulekaje kuvaditila vana venyu wubi wowuve, ino muvakagatsaje mu madahitso go mwanuche kuhuma kwa Mutwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatwa na vatantsi vawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Henye vatantsi muvahulikitsaje vatwa venyu kwa kuvahesimila iha ha inyi. Nanye muditaje ihyo kuhuma mu numbula ntsenyu kota hila fyo mungumuhulikitsa Chilisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Mulekaje kudita hala ho anguvawona hela ili mwilajile halutalo hake, ila muvatumichilaje kwa wukangatso kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu. Muditaje ihyo kwasawuli henye mu vatantsi va Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mukolaje katsi tsenyu kwa kuhechelela kota mungumuditila Mutwa Mulungu na siyo vanu hela. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Mwihukaje kuta Mutwa akumupela gweko chila munu yo an'dita ndongwa kwa wuwuya, nambe ave mutantsi awu siyo mutantsi.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Henye nanye vatwa muvaditilaje hihyo vatantsi venyu, na kaha mulekaje kuvakabusa. Mwihukaje kuta na henye munakota vene, kaha mwihukaje kuta munayo Mutwa va Kilanga yo alihela wubagulo wowuve.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kitovana mu inyi yo sinambe yiwoneche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Hawudugo ha baluva yino ntsin'gana mukangale mu wuhantso wa Mutwa na mu wuvetso wake wukomi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Ihyo mufwalaje fitovelo fyo avapelye Mulungu, na ihyo ho mufuluche kujisuma mipanjo jeka ja Lihoka, <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />kwakuva kitova kwa hetwe si twitovaga na vanu ndaya, ino twitovaga na vatavala, na vanya mamulaka na wuvetso va jitsa mu inyi yo sinambeyiwoneche. Kaha twitovaga na majesi ga mihoka ga inyi yo sinambeyiwoneche. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ihyo lelo mufwalaje fitovelo fyeka fya Mulungu, ili muvetse kusumana na luvala lwa ng'odeko. Ihyo ho hila ho mukuva kusinda kitovana mukwendelela kwima hihilaga.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Duve lelo mwivikaje chang'ani kuno wukweli wuvaje kota musipi mu figudi fyenyu, na kudichilwa na Mulungu kuvaje kota ngwebe ya mu mambaga tsenyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Nacho chimuhemuhe cha kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu ya wusichimafu chivaje kota filatu mu magulu genyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Chila luvala litumbilo livaje kota ngwebe mu mawoko genyu, ili yivatanje kutsitsimya magali tseka tsinya moto tso tsintotswa na Lihoka. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Kaha muwanuchilaje wukuluso ili wuve kota heti yenyu ya chuma, na mutegulaje Ndongwa tsa Mulungutsivaje kota waladi wo mumpelwa na Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Musukaje kwa kutangwa na Muhe va Mulungu chila luvala, ili Mulungu avatanje, na kaha muvasuchilaje bila wudugo vanu veka va Mulungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Musuchilaje na heni ili hala honguva ntsinvikula Ndongwa tsa Mulungu, mwene Mulungu amele ndongwa tsa kuvikula fiho tsa Ndongwa Nofu bila muloto goguve. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Heni yo jumbe va Ndongwa Nofu, nayivaje sambi ntsili mu nyumba ya vawopwa mbombitwe nyololo. Musuchilaje na heni ili ntsive na wukangatso wa kuyivikula Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo yin'ganika.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tsa kusindilitsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Ntsingumutuma kwenyu mung'olotsetu yo anchemwa Tikiko, nayo yo mutantsi muwuya va Mutwa. Mwene uyo akuvalonjela ndongwa tseka tsa heni, na henye ho mukuntsela fyontsili na chila cho ntsinkola kuno. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Ntsingumutuma kwenyu avalonjele ndongwa tsangu, ili avakangatswe numbula tsenyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ihyo vang'olotsangu ntsingumusuka Dada Mulungu na Mutwa Yesu Chilisito avapele henye wusichimafu, na wugano, na litumbilo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Kaha ntsingumusuka Mulungu avapele wuwuya henye nyeka wo mungumugana Yesu Chilisito Mutwa vetu kwa wugano wo wugaya wudugo.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>